  "name": "Therapy Intake",
  "description": "Gather a new counseling client's reasons for seeking help, symptoms, history, safety screening, goals and informed consent.",
  "category": "Healthcare",
  "seoTitle": "Free Therapy Intake Form Template for Counselors",
  "seoDescription": "Therapy intake form template for counselors: reason for seeking help, symptoms, past treatment, safety check, goals and informed consent before the first visit.",
